**/target/
**/*.class
**/*.jar
**/*.war
**/*.ear
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.rar

# Node & Angular Build Output
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
.npm
.yarn/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

